    "body": "Hi @davidkna, I'm not sure if \"reviewing clearing\" (https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/5072#discussion_r1274604551) also refers to this line. Hopefully this is not seen as ignoring your comment.\r\n\r\nPlease also consider that starship currently uses [CursorPosition.Y in the transient prompt code](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/c88aeeaf15acd95df649cb07c167cdd0056c2d1c/src/init/starship.ps1#L89C124-L89C155). So there is some precedent for querying the cursor position 👍",
